          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "India"
    },
    "eng": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "article": "place:India",
          "description": "A land located east of Persia, which formed the eastern boundary of the kingdom ruled by Ahasuerus (Esther 1:1).",
          "gloss": "India",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "India"
    },
    "fas": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "سرزمینی در شرق پارس که مرز شرقی پادشاهی تحت حکومت اخشورش (استر ۱:۱) را تشکیل می‌داد.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "هند"
    },
    "fra": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Un pays situé à l’est de la Perse, qui formait la frontière orientale du royaume dirigé par Assuérus (Esther 1.1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Inde"
    },
    "hau": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Wata ƙasa ce da take gabashin Farisa, wadda ta kafa iyakar gabas ta masarautar da Ahaswerus ya mallaka (Esther 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Indiya"
    },
    "hin": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "फारस के पूर्व में स्थित एक देश, जो क्षयर्ष (अहशवेरोश) द्वारा शासित साम्राज्य की पूर्वी सीमा बनाता था (एस्तेर 1:1)।",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "भारत"
    },
    "ibo": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Ala dị nʼakụkụ ọwụwa anyanwụ Peshịa, nke bụ ókèala ọwụwa anyanwụ nke alaeze Ahasuerọs (Ista 1:1) chịrị.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "India"
    },
    "ind": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Sebuah negeri yang terletak di sebelah timur Persia, yang menjadi batas timur kerajaan yang diperintah oleh Ahasyweros (Ester 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "India"
    },
    "nep": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "फारसको पूर्वमा अवस्थित एउटा देश, जसले अहासूरसद्वारा शासित राज्यको पूर्वी सिमाना बनाएको थियो (एस्तर १:१)।",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "भारत"
    },
    "por": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Uma terra localizada a leste da Pérsia, que formava o limite oriental do reino governado por Assuero (Ester 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Índia"
    },
    "rus": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Страна, расположенная к востоку от Персии, составлявшая восточную границу царства Артаксеркса (Есфирь 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Индия"
    },
    "spa": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Tierra situada al este de Persia, que formaba el límite oriental del reino gobernado por Asuero (Ester 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "India"
    },
    "swh": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Nchi iliyoko mashariki mwa Uajemi, ambayo iliunda mpaka wa mashariki wa ufalme uliotawaliwa na Ahasuero (Esta 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Bara Hindi"
    },
    "tpi": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Wanpela kantri i stap long hap sankamap bilong Persia, em i makim arere long hap sankamap bilong kingdom Serksis (Ahasuerus) i bin bosim (Ester 1:1).",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "India"
    },
    "vie": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Vùng đất nằm ở phía đông Ba Tư, từng là ranh giới phía đông của vương quốc do A-ha-suê-rút (A-suê-ru) cai trị (Ê-xơ-tê 1:1).",
